<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69133" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυλλαίνω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυλλός</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>distort
				the mouth, make mouths</i> or <i>mock at</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιλλαίνει</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυλλάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλλω</span>) <i>prostitute</i>, Id. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυλάς</span> cod.), <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυλάς</span>
			). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυλλάω</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυλλαίνω</span>
			, in pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμύλληκε</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλλη:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεῖα</span>, Id.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυμεῖ</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυλλίζω</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυλλαίνω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιλλαίνει</span>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
